+
+## Task identity
+
+Every task returned by `add` includes an `id`, a string that is unique within its list and remains the
+same if the task is renamed. Use `get(id)` to retrieve a task directly. `find`, `complete`, `reopen`,
+`rename`, `tag`, `untag`, and `remove` accept either a task title or its id.
